# Color usage

- **Coral `#CE6B69`** (`text-coral`, `bg-coral`): titles, headings, brand display type. Default `Heading` color.
- **Peach `#FF785E`** (`text-peach-500`, `bg-peach-500`, `text-destructive`, `variant="destructive"`): attention only.
- **Brown** (`text-brown-800`, `text-brown-500`): form labels, body, helper text. Never peach on labels.
- **Green** (`bg-green-500`): primary / complete actions.

## Peach is allowed only for

- Errors and alerts (`text-destructive`, error toasts)
- Report issue
- Sign out
- Connect printer (not yet connected)
- Incomplete setup, missing config, or destructive existing-item actions (archive, remove)

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — title or label in peach
<Heading className="text-peach-500">Catalog</Heading>
<FormControlLabelText className="text-peach-500">Name</FormControlLabelText>

// ✅ GOOD
<Heading>Catalog</Heading>
<FormControlLabelText>Name</FormControlLabelText>
<Text className="text-destructive">{error}</Text>
<Button variant="destructive"><ButtonText>Sign out</ButtonText></Button>
```
